LINK: https://platform.stratascratch.com/coding/10087-find-all-posts-which-were-reacted-to-with-a-heart?code_type=5
TYPE: Easy

==> My approach:
SELECT *
FROM facebook_posts AS p
WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1
    FROM facebook_reactions AS r
    WHERE p.post_id = r.post_id
         AND reaction = 'heart'
) ;
